"{    \"translations\": [        {            \"english_version\": \"The World Meteorological Organization has warned that a natural weather phenomenon could disrupt global economies. Millions of people are affected by smog, with over 12,000 children having breathing problems.\",            \"english_title\": \"Weather Warning\",            \"translated_version\": \"La Organizaci\u00f3n Meteorol\u00f3gica Mundial ha dicho que un fen\u00f3meno del clima puede afectar las econom\u00edas del mundo. Millones de personas tienen problemas por el smog, y m\u00e1s de 12,000 ni\u00f1os tienen problemas para respirar.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Advertencia del Clima\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Adeniyi Mobolaji Kayode, 46, faces charges including causing death by dangerous driving and reckless driving.\",            \"english_title\": \"Charges Against Driver\",            \"translated_version\": \"Adeniyi Mobolaji Kayode, de 46 a\u00f1os, tiene cargos por causar la muerte por manejar de forma peligrosa y manejar sin cuidado.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Cargos Contra Conductor\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Once-rival criminal groups are now working together due to a shortage of small boats, according to a BBC investigation.\",            \"english_title\": \"Criminal Groups Unite\",            \"translated_version\": \"Grupos criminales que antes eran rivales ahora trabajan juntos porque no hay suficientes botes peque\u00f1os, seg\u00fan una investigaci\u00f3n de la BBC.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Grupos Criminales Juntos\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Al-Mughayyir's council claims they were trying to prevent settlers from stealing sheep, but the Israeli military says they threw stones at its troops.\",            \"english_title\": \"Dispute Over Sheep\",            \"translated_version\": \"El consejo de Al-Mughayyir dice que intentaban evitar que los colonos robaran ovejas, pero el ej\u00e9rcito israel\u00ed dice que les lanzaron piedras a sus soldados.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Problema con Ovejas\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Rescuers found 44 survivors on a vessel, but bad weather forced them to leave five bodies behind.\",            \"english_title\": \"Rescue at Sea\",            \"translated_version\": \"Los rescatistas encontraron 44 sobrevivientes en un barco, pero el mal clima los oblig\u00f3 a dejar cinco cuerpos atr\u00e1s.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Rescate en el Mar\"        }    ]}"